OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe first hosts, Karen MacDonald
OL,9,     Fand Geoff Thomson, hope to offer a
OL,10,     Fslice of Zen at their relaxing
OL,11,     Fretreat, Just B, in Edinburgh. But
OL,12,     Fthere are dirty discoveries in a
OL,13,     Fdog-friendly room.
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FThe second visit is to Glencoe
OL,16,     FVilla Guest House in Featherstone,
OL,17,     FWest Yorkshire, owned by Ewa Hunt.
OL,18,     FBut the homely bedrooms aren't to
OL,19,     Feveryone's taste and there's a
OL,20,     Fdebate over dinner.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/13
