OL,5,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet to
OL,8,     Ffind out how much they've been
OL,9,     Fpaid. After dramatic discoveries
OL,10,     Fand cutting comments, the winner
OL,11,     Fis announced.
OL,12,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FWinchester. Live wire Ptol is
OL,14,     Fconvinced that high-quality food
OL,15,     Fand fine wine will win him the
OL,16,     Fprize. But his guests find his
OL,17,     Fmenu underwhelming and his hosting
OL,18,     Fstyle over the top. (Ep1/5)
